---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Submission Received"
  description="Thank you for bringing us into your world."
>
  <main class="prose reading submission-received">
    <div class="kicker">Submission Received</div>

    <h1>Thank you for bringing us into your world.</h1>

    <p>
      Your submission has been received for thoughtful consideration.
    </p>

    <p>
      Submission does <strong>not</strong> guarantee publication,
      response, endorsement, investigation, sharing, or follow-up.
      Some things may simply be read quietly. Some may shape future
      essays. Some may lead to deeper inquiry. Some may remain private.
    </p>

    <p>
      Either way, thank you for trusting us with something that mattered
      enough to send.
    </p>

    <div class="submission-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/essays">
        Return to Essays
      </a>

      <a class="button" href="/">
        Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
